---
// EthicsDecisionRight: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 320;
---
<figure class="edr">
  <div class="edr-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A patient with a rare disease shares medical scans with university researchers, but insurers and employers must not see any of it.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Privacy is a decision right, not secrecy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quyền riêng tư là quyền quyết định, không phải giữ bí mật</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>One patient, the same scans, three different answers.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một bệnh nhân, cùng các bản chụp, ba câu trả lời khác nhau.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="128" width="170" height="90" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={105} y={158} size={30} />
      <text x="105" y="190" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Patient with</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bệnh nhân mắc</tspan></text>
      <text x="105" y="206" class="bh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>a rare disease</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bệnh hiếm</tspan></text>
      <rect x="420" y="70" width="460" height="64" rx="8" class="box fix" />
      <DiagramIcon name="users" x={452} y={102} size={28} />
      <text x="484" y="98" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>University researchers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà nghiên cứu đại học</tspan></text>
      <text x="484" y="118" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Medical scans, shared on purpose</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ảnh chụp y khoa, chủ động chia sẻ</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow gold"><path d="M 190 173 L 415.2 103.5" /><polygon points="420,102 414.9,106.8 413.1,100.9" /></g>
      <rect x="420" y="150" width="460" height="64" rx="8" class="box dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={452} y={182} size={28} />
      <text x="484" y="178" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Insurers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hãng bảo hiểm</tspan></text>
      <text x="484" y="198" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Never see a single byte</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không được thấy một byte nào</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow dash"><path d="M 190 173 L 415.0 181.8" /><polygon points="420,182 413.6,184.8 413.8,178.7" /></g>
      <rect x="420" y="230" width="460" height="64" rx="8" class="box dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={452} y={262} size={28} />
      <text x="484" y="258" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Employers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà tuyển dụng</tspan></text>
      <text x="484" y="278" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Never see a single byte</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không được thấy một byte nào</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow dash"><path d="M 190 173 L 415.3 260.2" /><polygon points="420,262 413.0,262.6 415.2,256.9" /></g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The patient is not hiding anything. They choose who sees what, and for which purpose.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bệnh nhân không giấu gì cả. Họ chọn ai được xem gì, và cho mục đích nào.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .edr { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .edr-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .edr svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .edr text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .edr .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .edr .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edr .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .edr .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .edr .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .edr .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .edr .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .edr .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .edr .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edr .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .edr .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .edr .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edr .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edr .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .edr .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .edr .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .edr .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .edr .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .edr .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .edr .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .edr .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .edr .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .edr .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .edr figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
